<title>USA: Aquila sees increased cash burn rate in H2.</title>
<headline>Aquila sees increased cash burn rate in H2.</headline>
<dateline>WORCESTER, Mass. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aquila Biopharmaceuticals Inc said Tuesday it believes it will continue to achieve its product development plan but expects its cash burn rate to increase in the second half of 1997, compared to the first half, as its products advance in the clinical stage.</p>
</text>
